<hgroup><h1>Comparative Genome-Scale Metabolic Reconstruction and Flux Balance Analysis of Multiple <em>Staphylococcus aureus</em> Genomes Identify Novel Antimicrobial Drug Targets<sup><a href="#fn2" class="usa-link">▿</a></sup><sup> </sup><sup><a href="#fn1" class="usa-link">†</a></sup>
