<div class="p">Center for Complex Network Research and Departments of Physics, Biology, and Computer Science, Northeastern University, Boston, Massachusetts 02215,<sup>1</sup> Center for Cancer Systems Biology, Dana-Farber Cancer Institute, Boston, Massachusetts 02215,<sup>2</sup>  Department of Natural Medical Sciences, Inha University, Incheon, 402-751, Republic of Korea,<sup>3</sup> Integrated Genomics, Inc., Chicago, Illinois 60612,<sup>4</sup> Department of Pathology, University of Pittsburgh, Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania 15261,<sup>5</sup>  Biosciences and Biotechnology Division, Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory, Livermore, California 94551,<sup>6</sup> Department of Chemistry and Biochemistry, University of Notre Dame, Notre Dame, Indiana 46556<sup>7</sup>
