<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">The organism is missing an ORF for leucine transaminase (EC 2.6.1.6) and leucine dehydrogenase (EC 1.4.1.9). However, it is able to synthesize <span class="font-variant-small-caps">l</span>-leucine due to the presence of an ORF for branched-chain amino acid transaminase (EC 2.6.1.42)</td>
